{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人谷婭溦日前於社交網發長文，宣布約滿離巢無綫，結束11年的賓主關係，並分享一路以來的心路歷程，由隻身赴港打拚，到成功加入樂壇，在一直努力鍛煉下，成就了今天的自己，並表示離巢並非終結，而是全新的開始。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&amp;g</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T05:19:30.983886+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T03:54:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T05:12:51.593771+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T05:12:51.593771+00:00","content_hash":"5f8875381baa7f592ca7cb77332383b45997e8667fee992ff9dde9d16888b743","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}